{"unit_id":"lemonorangeapple__JuneAgent#card-zh","repo":"lemonorangeapple/JuneAgent","commit":"66b9d907f035a2972125c3e0b1d9917ca74d0776","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"JuneAgent 是面向 DSH Web 的双人格 Agent preset 与技能包。安装器将 June-M、June-S preset 及 git-backup、june-style 技能复制到 DSH 用户目录，已有目录会跳过。两个 preset 提供不同的编码协作人设，并配置文件、Shell、技能、计划和子 Agent 能力；技能分别提供 Git 备份流程及设计、代码风格指导。适合想在 DSH 中选择协作风格并复用技能的用户。通过 dsh plugin 命令安装，可用 DSH_HOME 指定目录，无需 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-65","presets/june-m/agent.cordis.yml:27-51","presets/june-s/agent.cordis.yml:27-51","skills/git-backup/SKILL.md:8-34","skills/june-style/SKILL.md:6-45","cordis.patch.yml:22-24"]}
