{"unit_id":"lemonorangeapple__JuneAgent#feature-1","repo":"lemonorangeapple/JuneAgent","commit":"66b9d907f035a2972125c3e0b1d9917ca74d0776","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"JuneAgent 的功能「June-M 与 June-S 人设」：提供两种编码和设计协作风格的 DSH agent preset。用户在新会话中选择对应 preset 后，即按其配置的人设、计划和工具能力工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["presets/june-m/agent.cordis.yml:27-51","presets/june-s/agent.cordis.yml:27-51"]}
{"unit_id":"lemonorangeapple__JuneAgent#feature-2","repo":"lemonorangeapple/JuneAgent","commit":"66b9d907f035a2972125c3e0b1d9917ca74d0776","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"JuneAgent 的功能「Git 备份指导」：git-backup 技能列出自动提交、不创建提交和询问后提交三种本地 Git 备份策略，并说明提交信息格式与常见冲突处理建议。Agent 按技能内容为用户提供操作指导。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/git-backup/SKILL.md:8-34","skills/git-backup/SKILL.md:36-72"]}
