{"unit_id":"lemonorangeapple__JuneAgent#caveat-1","repo":"lemonorangeapple/JuneAgent","commit":"66b9d907f035a2972125c3e0b1d9917ca74d0776","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"JuneAgent 使用前须知：preset 与技能会写入 DSH_HOME 下的用户目录；已有同名目录会被跳过，因此更新包不会覆盖这些目录中的现有内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-43","lib/index.js:45-55","lib/index.js:60-65"]}
